<title>NORWAY: NORSKE SKOG 9-MO PRE-TAX PROFITS DOWN.</title>
<headline>NORSKE SKOG 9-MO PRE-TAX PROFITS DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>			     (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Operating revenue	    9,938	vs	 9,076</p>
<p>Operating costs		7,515	vs	 6,863</p>
<p>Ordinary depreciation	  841	vs	   628</p>
<p>Restructuring costs	    100	vs	     0</p>
<p>Operating result	     1,482	vs	 1,585</p>
<p>Net financials	 minus   231	vs  minus  137</p>
<p>Result before tax	    1,324	vs	 1,482</p>
<p>Result after tax		 955	vs	 1,119</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian forestry group is Norske Skogindustrier ASA. None analysts polled by Reuters forecast nine-month operating profits at 1.63 billion crowns and a pre-tax result of 1.42 billion crowns.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
